builtin subgroupAdd ARG0 NUMERIC_T 1 must_use NONE
builtin subgroupMul ARG0 NUMERIC_T 1 must_use NONE
builtin subgroupMax ARG0 NUMERIC_T 1 must_use NONE
builtin subgroupMin ARG0 NUMERIC_T 1 must_use NONE
builtin subgroupAnd ARG0 INTEGER_T 1 must_use NONE
builtin subgroupOr ARG0 INTEGER_T 1 must_use NONE
builtin subgroupXor ARG0 INTEGER_T 1 must_use NONE
builtin subgroupExclusiveAdd ARG0 NUMERIC_T 1 must_use NONE
builtin subgroupExclusiveMul ARG0 NUMERIC_T 1 must_use NONE
builtin subgroupInclusiveAdd ARG0 NUMERIC_T 1 must_use NONE
builtin subgroupInclusiveMul ARG0 NUMERIC_T 1 must_use NONE
builtin subgroupBroadcast ARG0 NUMERIC_T 1 must_use NONE
builtin subgroupBroadcastFirst ARG0 NUMERIC_T 1 must_use NONE
builtin subgroupShuffle ARG0 NUMERIC_T 1 must_use NONE
builtin subgroupShuffleDown ARG0 NUMERIC_T 1 must_use NONE
builtin subgroupShuffleUp ARG0 NUMERIC_T 1 must_use NONE
builtin subgroupShuffleXor ARG0 NUMERIC_T 1 must_use NONE
builtin subgroupBallot VEC4U NONE 0 must_use NONE
